DETAIL:  Expected values are non-negative integers (timeout in seconds, 0 = disabled)
CREATE SERVER foo
FOREIGN DATA WRAPPER nominatim_fdw
OPTIONS (url 'http://server.im',
         request_timeout 'abc');
ERROR:  invalid request_timeout: 'abc'
DETAIL:  Expected values are non-negative integers (timeout in seconds, 0 = disabled)
